&lt;h1 id=&#34;your-procedural-toolbox-for-2d-content-creation&#34;&gt;Your procedural toolbox for 2D content creation
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Graphite is a free, open source vector and raster graphics engine, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://editor.graphite.rs&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;available now&lt;/a&gt; in alpha. Get creative with a fully nondestructive editing workflow that combines layer-based compositing with node-based generative design.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having begun life as a vector editor, Graphite continues evolving into a generalized, all-in-one graphics toolbox that&amp;rsquo;s built more like a game engine than a conventional creative app. The editor&amp;rsquo;s tools wrap its node graph core, providing user-friendly workflows for vector, raster, and beyond. Photo editing, motion graphics, digital painting, desktop publishing, and VFX compositing are additional competencies on the planned &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://graphite.rs/features/#roadmap&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;roadmap&lt;/a&gt; making Graphite into a highly versatile content creation tool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more from the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://graphite.rs/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;website&lt;/a&gt;, subscribe to the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://graphite.rs/#newsletter&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;newsletter&lt;/a&gt;, consider &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://graphite.rs/volunteer/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;volunteering&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://graphite.rs/donate/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;donating&lt;/a&gt;, and remember to give this repository a ⭐!&lt;/p&gt;
