&lt;h2 id=&#34;support-our-mission-&#34;&gt;Support our mission ❤️
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Graphite is 100% community built and funded. Please become a part of keeping the project alive and thriving with a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://graphite.rs/donate/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;donation&lt;/a&gt; if you share a belief in our &lt;strong&gt;mission&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphite strives to unshackle the creativity of every budding artist and seasoned professional by building the best comprehensive art and design tool that&amp;rsquo;s accessible to all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mission success will come when Graphite is an industry standard. A cohesive product vision and focus on innovation over imitation is the strategy that will make that possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
